1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 4=

2
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:09,360
What...

3
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:11,000
How could this happen?

4
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,840
What's going on?

5
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,040
How did it fall?

6
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:24,560
Exactly.

7
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:39,440
There's an assassin!

8
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,240
Who are you?

9
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,960
How dare you commit murder
right under my nose?

10
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,560
He Dang?

11
00:02:04,780 --> 00:02:07,140
(Zhaoming Office)

12
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:07,840
He Dang.

13
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,240
You've got some nerve.

14
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:13,720
On the day of the Imperial Retreat's
completion ceremony,

15
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,080
you openly committed murder

16
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:16,640
and killed Cheng Fu.

17
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:18,400
Tell us now.

18
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:19,880
Confess to the killing

19
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,320
and tell us exactly what happened.

20
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:23,480
Your Honor, I'm innocent.

21
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:25,160
I didn't kill anyone.

22
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,640
Innocent?

23
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:30,640
As a servant
from Prince Luan's Residence,

24
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:32,520
why did you go
to the Yushan Imperial Retreat?

25
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:33,800
I...

26
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:35,200
I...

27
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:37,840
Speak!

28
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,560
I...

29
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:42,800
I went there to steal.

30
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:43,640
Your Honor,

31
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:45,680
I have an elderly mother at home

32
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:47,040
who has been ill for years

33
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:48,480
and is bedridden.

34
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:49,750
Only a decoction of wild ginseng

35
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:52,040
can ease my mother's suffering

36
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:53,440
and keep her alive.

37
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:54,440
But

38
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,320
wild ginseng

39
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,560
is rare and expensive.

40
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:59,320
I simply can't afford it.

41
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,440
But if she stops taking it,

42
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,800
my mother may not have long to live.

43
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:05,640
As her son,

44
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:08,320
how could I bear to watch my own mother

45
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,480
die before my eyes?

46
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,600
I had no other choice,

47
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,560
and I lost all sense of reason.

48
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:14,400
I dared

49
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,400
to sneak into the Imperial Retreat

50
00:03:16,440 --> 00:03:18,360
and steal some valuables

51
00:03:18,370 --> 00:03:20,270
to pay for the medicine
that could save her life.

52
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:21,080
Your Honor.

53
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:22,960
I didn't kill anyone.

54
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,760
Your Honor,

55
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,920
I'm innocent!

56
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:29,840
Xiaobai.

57
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:36,360
What is He Dang usually like?

58
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:38,560
Uncle He Dang
has always treated me very well.

59
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:39,960
He's also kind to everyone.

60
00:03:40,110 --> 00:03:41,600
He wouldn't even dare kill a chicken.

61
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:43,080
How could he possibly kill someone?

62
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:44,800
There's only one way now.

63
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,320
It's all here.

64
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:51,000
Good.

65
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:22,920
Gunpowder?

66
00:04:38,220 --> 00:04:39,980
Who was the contractor
for the Yushan Imperial Retreat?

67
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,120
Contractor?

68
00:04:41,130 --> 00:04:43,300
I mean, who was in charge
of building the Imperial Retreat?

69
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:44,160
Cheng Gui.

70
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:45,280
Who's Cheng Gui?

71
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:46,800
He's Cheng Fu's younger brother.

72
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:47,320
He's

73
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:47,920
a carpenter.

74
00:04:48,380 --> 00:04:50,580
Then who was responsible
for installing this chandelier?

75
00:04:50,640 --> 00:04:51,520
Cheng Gui was.

76
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,760
This large chandelier

77
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:54,040
was made by him personally.

78
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,440
How did the brothers get along?

79
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:57,440
Quite well.

80
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,160
Cheng Fu, the supervisor, gave Cheng Gui

81
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:01,300
the lucrative job
of building the Imperial Retreat.

82
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:02,360
Thank you.

83
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,480
The silver is ready for you.

84
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,240
Go into hiding for a while.

85
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,880
Until I give the order,

86
00:05:12,110 --> 00:05:13,900
you are not to appear
in Bojue Kingdom again.

87
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:15,520
Yes.

88
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:16,720
As you command.

89
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,800
Then I'll take my leave.

90
00:05:27,740 --> 00:05:32,180
(Prince Luan's Residence)

91
00:05:32,180 --> 00:05:33,900
(Hundred Herbs Hall)

92
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:57,640
You dropped something!

93
00:06:03,900 --> 00:06:05,180
(Xichun Pavilion)

94
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:09,480
We have both

95
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,300
witness testimony

96
00:06:10,420 --> 00:06:11,290
and physical evidence.

97
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:12,500
You still dare deny it?

98
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:13,760
Very well.

99
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:16,520
Guards!

100
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:19,400
Put him to the torture.

101
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:20,840
Yes.

102
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,200
Yes.

103
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:22,920
I'm innocent!

104
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,320
I'm innocent!

105
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:31,200
He Dang.

106
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,520
Do you confess?

107
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,000
No.

108
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:35,960
I didn't kill anyone!

109
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:41,160
(Order)
Guards!

110
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:42,960
Put him to the clamps.

111
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,680
I'm innocent, Your Honor!

112
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:49,240
I...

113
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,600
I'm innocent!

114
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,760
Your Honor!

115
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,600
I'm innocent!

116
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,840
I confess!

117
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:05,920
I killed him.

118
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,680
I killed him.

119
00:07:17,620 --> 00:07:21,260
(Confession)

120
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:35,640
Wait!

121
00:07:43,840 --> 00:07:45,120
Advocate Jiang.

122
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,760
Why are you here again?

123
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:47,720
What brings you

124
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:48,800
here this time?

125
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:49,680
Your Honor,

126
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:51,080
I'm here to defend He Dang.

127
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:52,960
Advocate Jiang,

128
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:54,840
what do you have to say?

129
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,880
There are many doubts about
the case against He Dang for murder.

130
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:58,680
How can you close the case so hastily?

131
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:01,000
Many doubts?

132
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:05,720
Excuse me, please.

133
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:09,880
First,

134
00:08:10,180 --> 00:08:12,260
He Dang didn't have enough time
to commit the crime.

135
00:08:12,900 --> 00:08:15,390
This is the chandelier that crushed Cheng Fu
at the Yushan Imperial Retreat.

136
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:17,440
There are clear burn marks
on its support rod.

137
00:08:17,450 --> 00:08:18,830
The iron chain was also blown apart.

138
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:20,120
Such a complicated setup

139
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,990
could hardly have been
done by an ordinary person.

140
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:24,600
Even the most skilled craftsman

141
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,960
couldn't have completed

142
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,960
such intricate work in so little time.

143
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:31,080
Li San, a guard at Prince Luan's
Residence, can confirm

144
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:32,470
that on the day of the incident,

145
00:08:32,500 --> 00:08:34,960
He Dang didn't leave Prince Rong's
Residence until the Xu hour.

146
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,700
Cheng Fu was crushed
before the Hai hour.

147
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,160
Who in this world

148
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:40,720
could have done all this
within a single two-hour period?

149
00:08:41,680 --> 00:08:42,480
Second,

150
00:08:43,280 --> 00:08:45,000
He Dang had no motive
to commit the crime.

151
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,600
As everyone knows,

152
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:48,280
He Dang didn't even know Cheng Fu,

153
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,920
let alone have any grudge against him.

154
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:51,560
Why would he kill Cheng Fu?

155
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:55,480
He Dang said it himself.

156
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:58,600
Cheng Fu saw him stealing.

157
00:08:59,280 --> 00:09:00,720
He was afraid of being exposed,

158
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:01,960
so he decided to kill him.

159
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,280
He Dang has been
a devoted son since childhood.

160
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,200
To him,

161
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:06,480
his elderly mother
means more than anything.

162
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,240
Yes,

163
00:09:07,700 --> 00:09:09,040
he resorted to petty theft

164
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,600
to buy medicine for his mother.

165
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,640
But he also knew

166
00:09:12,900 --> 00:09:14,230
he couldn't afford to get into trouble.

167
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,350
Nothing could happen to him.

168
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:17,120
If something happened to him,

169
00:09:17,300 --> 00:09:19,400
his elderly mother
would have no one to care for her

170
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:21,080
and would die in misery.

171
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,400
Your Honor,

172
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,560
if you were in his place,

173
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,040
would you do something so foolish?

174
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:29,360
Shopkeeper Duan.

175
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:30,560
Do you recognize this man?

176
00:09:30,560 --> 00:09:31,360
Advocate Jiang.

177
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:32,800
Let me see.

178
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,040
Shopkeeper Duan.

179
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:35,160
Well?

180
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,160
I do.

181
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:37,320
That's He Dang.

182
00:09:37,460 --> 00:09:38,750
He's been buying medicine from me

183
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,120
for over ten years.

184
00:09:40,500 --> 00:09:42,080
As for the wild ginseng
used in Dushen Decoction,

185
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:42,920
besides Hundred Herbs Hall,

186
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,360
does any other pharmacy sell it?

187
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,080
No.

188
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,120
Mine is the only one.

189
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,240
How much does this kind
of wild ginseng cost?

190
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,560
Two taels of silver

191
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,080
and three hundred fifty wen.

192
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:52,200
All right.

193
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:54,920
Official Huang,

194
00:09:55,450 --> 00:09:56,360
the money on your desk

195
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,680
was found on He Dang, correct?

196
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:02,280
Do you know how much is there?

197
00:10:04,920 --> 00:10:06,200
Count it.

198
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:07,440
Yes.

199
00:10:12,040 --> 00:10:12,560
One...

200
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:13,480
Two...

201
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:16,280
Your Honor,

202
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:18,080
the stolen money totals

203
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,000
two taels of silver

204
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,640
and three hundred fifty wen.

205
00:10:21,660 --> 00:10:23,230
There was plenty of silver
in the Imperial Retreat,

206
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,590
far more than
a few hundred or thousand taels.

207
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:26,960
Why did he steal only two taels
and three hundred fifty wen?

208
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:28,240
Clearly,

209
00:10:28,380 --> 00:10:30,040
He Dang went
to the Yushan Imperial Retreat

210
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:31,960
only to get enough money
for his mother's medicine.

211
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:35,160
It was an act of desperation
by a devoted son.

212
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,400
He had absolutely no motive to kill.

213
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:42,120
But he just confessed himself.

214
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,160
Why did He Dang confess?

215
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:44,760
Surely you know why, Official Huang.

216
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,800
If you're accused

217
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:54,600
of forcing a confession through torture,

218
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,040
I'm afraid it would

219
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,400
seriously harm your career.

220
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,200
I understand.

221
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:00,680
I understand.

222
00:11:02,040 --> 00:11:04,040
When I went to the scene,

223
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:06,600
I learned that Cheng Gui,
the victim Cheng Fu's younger brother,

224
00:11:06,610 --> 00:11:08,640
was the contractor
for the Yushan Imperial Retreat.

225
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,360
The chandelier that fell

226
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:12,080
was designed by him

227
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:13,400
and installed by him personally.

228
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,400
So I believe

229
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:16,240
Cheng Gui

230
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:17,760
is the key

231
00:11:17,770 --> 00:11:18,760
to unraveling this mystery

232
00:11:18,780 --> 00:11:19,880
and finding the real killer.

233
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,200
Guards!

234
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,560
Go at once

235
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:26,120
and bring Cheng Gui here.

236
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:27,560
- Yes!
- Yes!

237
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,000
Report!

238
00:11:42,940 --> 00:11:45,260
(Nothing)

239
00:11:45,280 --> 00:11:46,080
Your Honor.

240
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:48,160
Your Honor.

241
00:11:50,660 --> 00:11:51,480
Where is Cheng Gui?

242
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:52,520
Cheng Gui has fled.

243
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,160
Fled?

244
00:11:58,170 --> 00:12:00,770
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

245
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:04,120
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

246
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:06,520
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

247
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:09,440
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

248
00:12:11,890 --> 00:12:14,310
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

249
00:12:14,680 --> 00:12:17,990
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

250
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:20,160
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

251
00:12:20,330 --> 00:12:23,660
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

252
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:29,270
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

253
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:32,880
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

254
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:35,940
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

255
00:12:35,940 --> 00:12:39,970
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

256
00:12:40,210 --> 00:12:43,260
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

257
00:12:43,630 --> 00:12:46,310
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

258
00:12:46,310 --> 00:12:49,060
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

259
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:52,280
♪I'll only say that once♪

260
00:12:52,770 --> 00:12:54,520
♪I called your name♪

261
00:12:59,140 --> 00:13:01,350
♪The silent stars hang low♪

262
00:13:02,770 --> 00:13:04,980
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

263
00:13:06,220 --> 00:13:08,110
♪I linger in the old tower♪

264
00:13:08,260 --> 00:13:11,890
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

265
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:15,660
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

266
00:13:16,540 --> 00:13:19,320
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

267
00:13:20,090 --> 00:13:22,330
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

268
00:13:22,330 --> 00:13:28,570
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

269
00:13:28,830 --> 00:13:31,710
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

270
00:13:32,310 --> 00:13:35,810
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

271
00:13:35,810 --> 00:13:38,450
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

272
00:13:38,450 --> 00:13:42,740
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

273
00:13:42,740 --> 00:13:45,650
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

274
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:48,800
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

275
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:51,470
♪If we meet again in another life♪

276
00:13:51,790 --> 00:13:54,520
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

277
00:13:55,210 --> 00:13:57,500
♪Was when we first met?♪

278
00:13:58,780 --> 00:14:01,160
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

279
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:04,050
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
